    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4204" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλικνήμῑς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑδος</span>,
