				<u>D.</u>
				43.199
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλίκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
